1
00:00:00,163 --> 00:00:04,413
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, after a moment of silent meditation,
I'm gonna end with "in Jesus' name"...

2
00:00:04,584 --> 00:00:07,334
(Mrs Cooper:)...but you two
don't feel any obligation to join in.

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:12,420
(Mrs Cooper:)Unless, of course,
the Holy Spirit moves you.

4
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:24,020
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
this is the best cobbler I've ever had.

5
00:00:24,187 --> 00:00:27,857
It was always Sheldon's favorite.
You know what the secret ingredient is?

6
00:00:28,024 --> 00:00:29,564
- Love?
- Lard.

7
00:00:34,822 --> 00:00:38,202
- Hey, look who's com...
- Shh. You'll spook him.

8
00:00:40,411 --> 00:00:42,871
(Mrs Cooper:)He's like a baby deer.
You gotta let him come to you.

9
00:00:51,339 --> 00:00:52,589
(Leonard:)This is ridiculous.

10
00:00:52,757 --> 00:00:54,387
Damn it, Sheldon, snap out of it.

11
00:00:54,926 --> 00:01:03,026
(Leonard:)You're a physicist. You belong at the
university doing research, not in your room.

